<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#mode-dream> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ManifestationMode> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#mode-possession> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Possession"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#mode-auditory> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Manifestation asserted to occur through sound, voice, drumming, or hearing — including traditions where specific rhythms summon or identify a spirit."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#mode-auditory> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ManifestationModeScheme> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#mode-territorial> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Manifestation asserted to be bound to or expressed through a place, crossroads, body of water, forest, or territory."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-manifestation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
