<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#mode-auditory> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Auditory"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#mode-territorial> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ManifestationMode> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#hasManifestationMode> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Associates a ManifestationEvent or assertion node with a ManifestationMode concept from iroko:ManifestationModeScheme. Multiple modes may be asserted for a single event."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#mode-divination> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ManifestationModeScheme> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#hasMediumType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Associates a Medium with a MediumType concept from iroko:MediumTypeScheme."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#mode-unknown> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Manifestation mode not recorded or not known."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ManifestationModeScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Manifestation Modes"@en .
