<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-manifestation> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Iroko Historical Society" .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#mode-possession> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Manifestation asserted to occur through mounting or possession of a medium person. The agent speaks and acts through the medium during the event."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-manifestation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#seeAlso> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-framework/> .
