<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#mode-symbolic> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Manifestation asserted to occur through symbols, signs, graphic marks, or indirect representation. Vèvè, firmas, and anaforuana are common vehicles."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ManifestationModeScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#mode-symbolic> .
