<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#mode-dream> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Manifestation asserted to occur through dreams, dream visitation, or hypnagogic contact."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#MediumType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A SKOS concept categorizing the kind of medium involved in a manifestation assertion: person, object, place, text, instrument, or unknown."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ManifestationModeScheme> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Controlled terms for how sacred agents are asserted to manifest. Tradition-reported descriptive categories. Multiple modes may apply to a single event."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#mode-unknown> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ManifestationModeScheme> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-manifestation> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Governance Layer module. Vocabulary for modeling how sacred agents are asserted to manifest — through embodied presence, possession, dream, divination, symbolic representation, territorial claim, or auditory sign. Plugs into iroko:ManifestationEvent and supports iroko:TemporalVariation where manifestation modes shift by ritual calendar or initiation cycle. These are descriptive, not metaphysical — they record what a tradition asserts in its own terms. Composes with iroko-narrative for temporal regime documentation and iroko-authority for assertion authorization."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#medium-person> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Person"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#medium-unknown> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-manifestation> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#Medium> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Medium"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#medium-instrument> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-manifestation> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#MediumTypeScheme> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Controlled terms for the kind of medium through which manifestation is asserted to occur."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#mode-divination> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Manifestation asserted to occur through divination, oracle, or the interpretive reading of divinatory instruments."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-manifestation> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Iroko Framework: Manifestation Module"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ManifestationModeScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#mode-unknown> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#MediumTypeScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-manifestation> .
